      "writtenOn": "2015-03-11T03:28:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For now, yes.  blueprint.DynamicDepenencies (which this wraps) uses a returned []string as a list of global-namespace dependencies.  Since everything in here is namespaced, it gets added through AddNamespacedDependencies instead of returned.  If we added any global namespaced dependencies (for example, see ccBinary\u0027s AndroidDynamicDependencies) then they would be returned in deps.",
      "parentUuid": "fc53d9fa_109f6460",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 488,
