        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-03-11T03:28:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "AndroidModule is an interface, and a variable whose type is an interface is a pointer to anything that satisifies that interface.  In this case, it\u0027s a pointer to the AndroidModule that contains this AndroidModuleBase (for example ccBase), and is used so that methods implemented on AndroidModuleBase can call methods implemented by ccBase.",
      "parentUuid": "fc53d9fa_70ac306e",
